is originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمَّا</span>, [for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْ مَا</span>,] the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ا</span> being elided
